 3. ⚡️ Catch me up 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Photo: Megan Varner/Getty Images 🐼 Zoo Atlanta's new pandas made their public debut today, with smiling visitors lining up to welcome Ping Ping and Fu Shuang. They're on loan from China under a 10-year agreement. Go deeper . 🛻 Tesla will wind down Cybertruck production next year "to make room for increased Cybercab production," CEO Elon Musk wrote on X . The move reflects Tesla's focus on autonomous vehicles, but also comes amid slowing sales for the divisive electric truck. Go deeper . 🕯️ John D. Rockefeller IV, a former West Virginia governor and senator who pushed to expand health insurance coverage, died today at home in Washington at 89. N.Y. Times obit (gift link). 
 
