 4. ✈️ 1 for the road: The new &quot;Voice of Logan&quot; 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Chris Donisi. Photo: Massport The new "Voice of Logan" belongs to a baritone pipe fitter born and raised just outside Boston, Axios Boston's Steph Solis reports. 

 Chris Donisi won a contest to record welcome messages for travelers at Boston Logan International Airport. 🎙️ Donisi, whose mother encouraged him to compete, told reporters yesterday: "I'm one of you guys ... You probably sat next to me at one of the bars in Boston. You've probably waved to me or given me the finger in traffic — one or the other. We're still all friends."

